  "scoring_notes": "8 items per domain (physical, physiological, psychological), 24 total. Score = count of options selected per dosha, converted to percentage of 24. Dominant Prakriti = highest percentage; note in the UI when two doshas are close (e.g. within ~15%) since dual-dosha types are the norm, not the exception."
